<title>EGYPT: Hoechst Orient results for Q1 1997.</title>
<headline>Hoechst Orient results for Q1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first quarter of the 1997 calendar year, the company's financial year.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available)</p>
<p>January to March 1997</p>
<p> Net sales	   39,991,032</p>
<p> Production costs  29,441,054</p>
<p> Expenditure	  9,810,589</p>
<p> Exceptional revenues 337,160</p>
<p>Net profits</p>
<p>  before tax	  1,076,549</p>
<p>Full company name is Hoechst Orient, which is a subsidiary of German firm Hoechst Ag.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom + 202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
